  "question": {
    "text": "In the following sets of reactants which two sets best exhibit the amphoteric character of Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> . xH<sub>2</sub>O ?<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Set I</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>Al</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>&#183;</mo> <msub> <mtext>xH</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>s</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>OH</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>-</mo> </msubsup> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Set II</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>Al</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>s</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </msub> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Set III</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>Al</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>s</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>aq</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> </msubsup> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Set IV</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>Al</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>&#183;</mo> <msub> <mtext>xH</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mro